{"suttaId":"an5.59","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-v","vriCode":"s0403m1.mul","paras":[522,522],"vripara":"59"},"segments":{"an5.59:0.3":"Paṭhamavuḍḍhapabbajitasuttaṃ","an5.59:1.1":"“Pañcahi, bhikkhave, dhammehi samannāgato dullabho vuḍḍhapabbajito.","an5.59:1.2":"Katamehi pañcahi?","an5.59:1.3":"Dullabho, bhikkhave, vuḍḍhapabbajito nipuṇo, dullabho ākappasampanno, dullabho bahussuto, dullabho dhammakathiko, dullabho vinayadharo.","an5.59:1.4":"Imehi kho, bhikkhave, pañcahi dhammehi samannāgato dullabho vuḍḍhapabbajito”ti.","an5.59:1.5":"Navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-v","bookName":"Pañcakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0403a.att","from":150,"to":150,"paras":[{"para":150,"vripara":"59-60","refs":["an5.59:1"],"lines":["59-60. Navame <b>nipuṇo</b>ti saṇho sukhumakāraṇaññū.","<b>Ākappasampanno</b>ti samaṇākappena sampanno.","Dasame <b>padakkhiṇaggāhī</b>ti dinnovādaṃ padakkhiṇato gaṇhanto.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["an5.59:1"],["an5.59:1"],["an5.59:1"],["an5.59:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an5.59:1.3","nipuṇo",0,0],["an5.59:1.3","ākappasampanno",0,1]],"before":[{"para":149,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["9-10. Vuḍḍhapabbajitasuttadvayavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-v","bookName":"Pañcakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":152,"to":157,"paras":[{"para":152,"vripara":"58-60","refs":["an5.59:1"],"lines":["58-60. Aṭṭhame <b>sāpateyyan</b>ti ettha saṃ vuccati dhanaṃ, tassa patīti sapati, dhanasāmiko.","Tassa hitāvahattā sāpateyyaṃ, drabyaṃ, dhananti attho.","Attano rucivasena gāmakiccaṃ netīti gāmaniyo, gāmaniyoyeva <b>gāmaṇiko</b>."],"lineRefs":[["an5.59:1"],["an5.59:1"],["an5.59:1"]]},{"para":153,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.59:1"],"lines":["Anvāya upanissāya jīvanasīlā <b>anujīvino</b>ti āha <b>“ye ca etaṃ upanissāya jīvantī”</b>ti.","Ekaṃ mahākulaṃ nissāya paṇṇāsampi saṭṭhipi kulāni jīvanti, te manusse sandhāyetaṃ vuttaṃ.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyameva.","Navamādīni uttānatthāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an5.59:1"],["an5.59:1"],["an5.59:1"],["an5.59:1"]]},{"para":154,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.59:1"],"lines":["Licchavikumārakasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an5.59:1"]]},{"para":155,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.59:1"],"lines":["Nīvaraṇavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an5.59:1"]]},{"para":156,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.59:1"],"lines":["(7)2. Saññāvaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an5.59:1"]]},{"para":157,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.59:1"],"lines":["1-5. Saññāsuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an5.59:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
